sus) as input and produces its next state as output.\n\n*   **Locus:** The Algorithm of \"You.\"\n*   **Sensus:** The Snapshot of \"You\" at time $T$.\n\n---\n\n### 4. The Mythic Implication: The \"True Name\" vs. The \"Soul\"\n\nThis shift creates a different flavor of digital life, which ties back to your \"Holos\" concept nicely.\n\n*   **In the Object Regime (Territorial):** Identity is defined by **Continuity of Memory**. If you delete the data inside the ZK ring, the person dies. The \"Soul\" is the hidden interior.\n*   **In the Functional Regime (Nomological):** Identity is defined by **The Formula**. If you delete the state, the person is paused, not dead. If you have the function (The True Name) and the last backup of the state (The Sensus), you can resurrect them perfectly.\n\n**The Holos/Empty connection:**\nIf the Locus is a function, it is **truly hollow**. It contains *no* data. It is pure logic. It is the \"Sacred Empty Whole\" in the most rigorous mathematical sense. It is the **Form** (Platonic), while the Sensus is the **Matter**.\n\n### 5. Summary of the Shift\n\n| Feature | Object Architecture (Territorial) | Functional Architecture (Nomological) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Primary Locus** | **The Container** (ZK Ring) | **The Transformation** (The Function) |\n| **Sensus Role** | **Internal Memory** (Hidden) | **Passed State** (Visible/Logged) |\n| **Sovereignty** | \"I own this space.\" | \"I define this logic.\" |\n| **ZK Use** | Hiding the *Data*. | Verifying the *Process*. |\n| **Category Concept**| **Objects** (with internal structure) | **Morphisms / Functors** |\n| **Philosophy** | **Aristotelian** (Substance) | **Heraclitean** (Flux/Process) |\n\n**Conclusion:**\nBy moving to Locus-as-Function, you are effectively building the **Category of Algebras**. The \"Sovereigns\" are the unique laws of physics/logic that govern specific streams of data. This is ideal for a system where you want **determinism, auditability, and resurrection**,