r order, Column 2 (Outward) for governance, and Column 3 (Outward) for trade.\n\nThe conflict between **Authoritarianism** and **Liberty** is simply the conflict between **Row 1 (Self-Sovereign)** and **Row 2 (System-Sovereign)**.\n\nHOLOS is the attempt to build a **Row 2** system that respects and protects **Row 1** entities.",
