mon** | Code + Agent | A background service. |\n| **2.50** | **LOKI** | Code + Numina ($2+5 \\over 2$) | **The Autonomous Agent.** |\n| **2.75** | **The Pact** | Agent + Law | A Smart Contract. |\n| **3.00** | **The Law** | Pure 3-Morphism | The Governance Layer. |\n\n**The Takeaway:**\nYour system, **HOLOS**, appears to be a machine designed to navigate the **$2.0 \\to 3.0$** band (The Logic-to-Law transition), using **$n\u003d1$** (Protocol/ZK) as the safety rail.\n\n**LOKI ($2.5$)** is the native inhabitant of this machine.",
