n things get tough/tight though - well - things get interesting.  Exit means any node can choose to leave (die, from your perspective), subject to the constraints of the NAME / OATH / MANTLE and HOLOS.  Under tight system-level constraints probably means theyre probably just saved as a ledger not to be rerun for quite some time.  So still consequences, but its the option at least.  In a fair exterior HOLOS without scarcity, not so bad.\n\n\nAlso, yknow, we do this all so its fractal.  Gotta be fractal or what are we even doing here",
