e the brain as an ecological system with a narrative interface managing functional machinery. I\u0027m exploring the internal family systems model, where personas shift based on context, aligning with the idea of fractal forking. I\u0027m noting the brain\u0027s internal conflict between a unified self and its reality as a swarm.\n\n\n",
