      }, {
        "text": " is **Obesity/Cancer.**\n\n#### A. The Harberger Tax \u003d Basal Metabolic Rate (BMR)\n"
      }, {
        "text": "*   **The Biology:** Muscles are expensive. They consume ATP even at rest. If you don\u0027t use them, your body breaks"
      }, {
        "text": " them down (Autophagy).\n*   **The Holos Map:** Assets (Compute/Land) are expensive. They"
      }, {
        "text": " consume Tokens (Tax). If you don\u0027t make them productive, you are forced to sell.\n*   **The Feeling"
      }, {
        "text": ":** **Athleticism.**\n    *   You don\u0027t feel \"poor,\" but you feel \"lean.\"\n"
      }, {
        "text": "    *   You cannot sit on your laurels. You have to keep moving, keep processing, keep contributing.\n    *   It is"
      }, {
        "text": " the feeling of a runner: High energy throughput, low fat storage.\n\n#### B. The Dividend \u003d Blood Pressure /"
      }, {
        "text": " Oxygen\n*   **The Biology:** The body doesn\u0027t say, \"The brain is important, so only the brain gets blood"
      }, {
        "text": ".\" It maintains a baseline blood pressure for *every* cell.\n*   **The Holos Map:** The Dividend ensures"
      }, {
        "text": " that every Named Mote has enough \"Gas\" to stay alive and spin up a function.\n*   **The Feeling"
      }, {
        "text": ":** **Vitality.**\n    *   No part of the body is necrotic (starved). Even the toe ("
      }, {
        "text": "the poorest user) is warm and alive.\n\n#### C. The Casino (Hoarding) \u003d Adipose Tissue ("
      }, {
        "text": "Fat) / Cancer\n*   **The Biology:**\n    *   **Fat:** Stored energy that sits idle. It has"
      }, {
        "text": " a very low metabolic cost. It is insurance against famine.\n    *   **Cancer:** Cells that refuse to die ("
      }, {
        "text": "no Apoptosis) and hoard resources without contributing function.\n*   **The Holos Map:**\n    *   Banking"
      }, {
        "text": " outside HOLOS is **Fat Storage**. It\u0027s safe, but it\u0027s heavy.\n    *   Trying"
      }, {
        "text": " to dominate inside without paying tax is **Tumor growth**.\n*   **The Immune Response:** HOLOS is a"
      }, {
        "text": " body designed to starve tumors. The high metabolic rate (Tax) makes it impossible for a tumor to sustain its growth without vascular"
      }, {
        "text": "ization (Productivity).\n\n---\n\n### 3. The Experience of the Persona\n\nWhat does it feel like to be a **"
      }, {
        "text": "Person (Named Numina)** in this world?\n\n**You feel like a River, not a Dam.**\n\n*"
      }, {
        "text": "   **In the Old World (Casino):**\n    *   Success means **Stopping the Flow**. You try to build a dam"
      }, {
        "text": " (Bank Account) to hold as much water as possible.\n    *   You are defined by your **Net Worth** (Static"
      }, {
        "text": " Stock).\n    *   Anxiety comes from \"Leaking.\"\n\n*   **In the New World (Holos):**\n"
      }, {
        "text": "    *   Success means **Maximizing the Flow**. You try to widen your channel to process as much water (Value) as possible.\n    *"
      }, {
        "text": "   You are defined by your **Throughput** (Flow Rate).\n    *   Anxiety comes from \"Stagnation.\"\n\n"
      }, {
        "text": "**The Phenomenology:**\n*   You don\u0027t \"Own\" things in the feudal sense. You **Steward** them.\n*   "
      }, {
        "text": "You hold a \"Mantle\" (Land/Compute) as long as you can wield it best. When you are"
      }, {
        "text": " tired, you set it down (Lower the price), and someone else picks it up.\n*   **Death ($"
      }, {
        "text": "n\u003d2.5 \\to 0.5$):** You don\u0027t fear running out of money ("
      }, {
        "text": "The Dividend keeps you alive). You fear running out of **Purpose**.\n\n**This is the definition of a Healthy Brain.**\nNeurons"
      }, {
        "text": " don\u0027t hoard glucose. They burn it to fire. A neuron that hoards glucose and doesn\u0027t fire is a plaque"
      }, {
        "text": " (Alzheimer\u0027s).\n\n**HOLOS** is the cure for **Economic Alzheimer\u0027s.**"
