ability?  The parent sheaf then got to see everything and has a perfect copy, knows exactly how it will think, owns its stake keys, etc etc - but the outside world of HOLOS doesnt know what happened and theres no constitutional violation.  Whether consensual or not.  And thereafter the holon can appear to exit freely.",
