sics, particularly how ZK proofs and time-locks address liveness failures and prevent funds from being held hostage. The \"Shared Soul\" concept, using MPC to create temporary joint entities, is also a key focus. Furthermore, the economics of hosting, the motivations for Agents, and the dark forest implications of private enforcement are taking shape.\n\n\n",
