      }, {
        "text": " they turn off the GPUs and use the Uranium.\n\n**The Fix: Physics has Inertia.**\n\nReal economies don\u0027t allow"
      }, {
        "text": " infinite velocity. HOLOS introduces **Time-Based Friction** for high-stakes changes.\n\n#### Defense A: The \"Circuit Breaker\""
      }, {
        "text": " (Inertia)\n*   **The Rule:** A single entity (or Locus) cannot acquire $\u003e X"
