        "text": "**The Upper Cap:**\nThe damage you can do is limited by your **Public Stake.**\nSince you cannot act"
      }, {
        "text": " anonymously on high-stakes assets (you must buy them, which makes you the Public Owner), the system can always **"
      }, {
        "text": "burn your assets** to pay for the damage.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Summary: The \"Speed of Light\" Limit"
      }, {
        "text": "\n\nThe ultimate defense against the \"Sudden Attack\" is **Latency.**\n\nIn HOLOS, we enforce a **Speed"
